---
/**
 * PricingAnchor - cost comparison: repair vs replacement
 * The most powerful conversion tool on the site
 */
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-ink">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-bone mb-4">
        Before you spend thousands on replacement
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-bone/70">
        Here's what repair actually costs
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
      <!-- Replacement option -->
      <div class="bg-bone/10 border-2 border-bone/20 rounded-lg p-8 lg:p-12">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <p class="text-sm font-display text-bone/60 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">
            Typical cost
          </p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-bone mb-2">
            Replacement
          </h3>
          <p class="text-bone/70">Full window/door replacement</p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-end pb-2 border-b border-bone/20">
            <span class="text-bone/70">Per window (sash window)</span>
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-bone">£2,500–£4,000</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-end pb-2 border-b border-bone/20">
            <span class="text-bone/70">Per door frame</span>
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-bone">£1,200–£2,500</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-end pb-2 border-b border-bone/20">
            <span class="text-bone/70">Planning permission</span>
            <span class="font-display text-lg text-rust">Often required</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-bone/70 text-sm">
          Plus: delays, architect sign-off, listed building consent, disposal costs, disruption.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Repair option (highlighted) -->
      <div class="bg-patina/20 border-2 border-patina rounded-lg p-8 lg:p-12 relative">
        <div class="absolute -top-4 right-6 bg-patina text-ink px-4 py-1 rounded-full font-display text-sm uppercase">
          Repair-first
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
          <p class="text-sm font-display text-patina uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">
            Typical cost
          </p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-bone mb-2">
            Repair
          </h3>
          <p class="text-bone/70">Expert restoration, original fabric preserved</p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-end pb-2 border-b border-patina/30">
            <span class="text-bone/70">Per window (sash window)</span>
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-patina">£350–£800</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-end pb-2 border-b border-patina/30">
            <span class="text-bone/70">Per door frame</span>
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-patina">£250–£600</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-end pb-2 border-b border-patina/30">
            <span class="text-bone/70">Planning permission</span>
            <span class="font-display text-lg text-patina">Usually none</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-bone/70 text-sm">
          Includes: full restoration, grain matching, timber splice, finishing. No disruption. No paperwork.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Savings calculation -->
    <div class="bg-rust/10 border-2 border-rust rounded-lg p-8 text-center mb-12">
      <p class="text-bone/70 mb-3">3-window restoration vs replacement:</p>
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-center gap-4">
        <span class="font-display text-3xl text-rust">£6,000–£11,000</span>
        <span class="text-bone/70">savings</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-bone/70 mt-4">Plus: no planning delays, original features preserved, property value maintained.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <p class="text-lg text-bone/70 mb-6">
        Ready to find out what your repair actually costs?
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-patina text-ink font-display rounded-md hover:bg-patina/90 transition-colors"
      >
        Send photos for a repair estimate
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
